    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Coterie of the Conceited",
    "summary": "As each battle round starts with your **WARLORD** on the battlefield, pledge to Slaanesh how many enemy units you predict will be destroyed this round; the pledge is compulsory. When the round ends:\n\n- If at least that many enemy units were destroyed this round, gain as many Pact points as you pledged.\n- Otherwise, you gain no Pact points this round, and D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** are inflicted on your **WARLORD** model.\n\n**EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** units of yours get every bonus for the Pact points gained so far in the battle; the bonuses add up:\n\n- 1 or more: their attacks re-roll Hit rolls of 1.\n- 3 or more: their attacks also re-roll Wound rolls of 1.\n- 5 or more: their models' melee weapons have **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** and **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- 7 or more: unmodified Hit rolls of 5+ for their attacks score Critical Hits.",
